 strong personality, but at her core she is kind and sometimes smiles.\n\nWe will continue to support you, Hibiki Hurt.\nI eagerly await your work!", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 256, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u7b46\u798d\uff20\u3074\u304b\u3059\u3059\uff08\u4eee\uff09\u5236\u4f5c\u4e2d", "screen_name": "hikka06", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2006119699592142849/fJ43NdIe.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/85097065/1737786245/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 14, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "nc": 32}, {"id": 1015831, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u56db\u65b9\u5c71\u661f\u56e3\u306e\u3088\u3082\u304e", "screen_name": "yomogi_0v0_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2006753278361776128/fplssNvr.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1000408610420047872/1617295051/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "voice"}, {"genre": "novel"}], "nc": 145}, {"id": 2001272, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u9b3c\u30e2\u30c1", "screen_name": "ONImotimo", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1576241849819242497/gxWXXEWi.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1508027474323832836/1770124263/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester